guide completionist-horde/dungeon-deadmines
title Deadmines (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 20-25
zone Westfall
pitch Deadmines, in Westfall.
why Every Horde quest of Deadmines: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

step Getting there
